Driver functions:
    Multimeter
Scan options:
    conn
hp-3478a - Hewlett-Packard 3478A with 1 channel: P1
Supported configuration options:
    continuous: on, off
    limit_samples: 0 (current)
    limit_time: 0 (current)
    measured_quantity:  - supported measurements:
      voltage/dc (current)
      voltage/ac
      current/dc
      current/ac
      resistance
      resistance/four_wire
    range: Auto (current), 30mV, 300mV, 3V, 30V, 300V
    digits: 3.5, 4.5, 5.5 (current)
